  {
    "name": "Unwanted Cargo",
    "displayName": null,
    "description": "Bring a Hai child who hid in your cargo hold back to <destination>.",
    "raw": [
      {
        "key": "minor",
        "values": [],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "landing",
        "values": [],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "description",
        "values": [
          "Bring a Hai child who hid in your cargo hold back to <destination>."
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "source",
        "values": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "not",
            "values": [
              "government",
              "Hai",
              "Hai (Unfettered)"
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "not",
            "values": [
              "near",
              "Heia Due",
              0,
              100
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "destination",
        "values": [
          "Allhome"
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "to",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "has",
            "values": [
              "event: hai in cargo"
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "The \"Check Cargo\" light for your ship begins blinking when you land, meaning that a cargo crate may have come loose in flight. You shut off the ship's engines and walk to the cargo hold.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou check every cargo crate in the hold, but can't find anything wrong. Right as you decide to leave, one of the smaller crates begins rocking back and forth.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "branch",
                "values": [
                  "translator"
                ],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "has",
                    "values": [
                      "language: Hai"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou hear a voice come from the crate, but it is not a language you understand. The voice continues to speak, and you recognize it as the Hai language.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t(Open the crate.)",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou open the crate and are met face to face with a Hai child. You aren't sure how old they are, but they look to be about the size of a one-year-old human child. They try to communicate with you, but begins to cry when they see the confused look on your face.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Don't cry, little guy.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "cry"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t(Pick up the Hai.)",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe child waves its hands around when you try to pick them up, making it impossible to grab on to. After waiting for a few minutes, the child finally calms down, eventually going to sleep in the crate.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "goto",
                    "values": [
                      "end"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "cry"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe child begins to cry even louder than before. After waiting for a few minutes, the child finally calms down, eventually going to sleep in the crate.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "goto",
                    "values": [
                      "end"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "translator"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou hear a voice come from the crate, and surprisingly your Hai translator begins speaking. \"Let me out! I want to go home!\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t(Open the crate.)",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou open the crate and are met eye to eye with a Hai child. You aren't sure how old they are, but it looks to be about the size of a one-year-old human child. \"I want my mommy!\" they say as its eyes begin to tear up.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Where's your mommy?\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Don't cry, little guy.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe child looks surprised when your translation device speaks to them in Hai. \"Take me home!\" they yell back at you. You attempt to find out where the child's home is, but they continue to cry for its mother without giving any important information.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "end"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThis child must have somehow gotten into your cargo hold while you were in Hai space. Leaving a Hai child on this world would be an extremely bad idea. Perhaps someone on <destination> will be able to bring the child back to its family.",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "accept",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "complete"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "payment",
            "values": [
              50000
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "dialog",
            "values": [
              "You contact the spaceport authorities of <planet> and ask them if they are looking for a lost Hai child. It turns out that the family was so worried that they put up a <payment> reward for finding their son. A Hai spaceport worker takes the child from your ship and thanks you for finding him for the family."
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
