  {
    "name": "Hiding in Plain Sight",
    "displayName": null,
    "description": "Bring Arthur and his Hai friend Kiru to <destination> for a gaming convention by <date>.",
    "raw": [
      {
        "key": "description",
        "values": [
          "Bring Arthur and his Hai friend Kiru to <destination> for a gaming convention by <date>."
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "minor",
        "values": [],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "source",
        "values": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "government",
            "values": [
              "Hai"
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "not",
            "values": [
              "attributes",
              "station"
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "destination",
        "values": [
          "Vinci"
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "passengers",
        "values": [
          2
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "deadline",
        "values": [
          30
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "to",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "random",
            "values": [
              "<",
              30
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "has",
            "values": [
              "First Contact: Hai: offered"
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "While eating in a spaceport cafeteria that serves both Hai and human cuisine, you are approached by a teenage human and Hai. \"Hello. Do you know how to get to <destination>?\" the Hai asks.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"I do. Why do you want to go there?\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"I don't. You'll have to ask someone else.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "decline",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "branch",
                "values": [
                  "public"
                ],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "has",
                    "values": [
                      "event: hai-human resolution announced"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe human responds, \"There's a massive convention on <planet> for a game called 'Boundless Frontiers.' The convention has a huge cosplaying scene, and I think Kiru would fit right in.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "goto",
                    "values": [
                      "return"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "public"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe human responds, \"There's a massive convention on <planet> for a game called 'Boundless Frontiers.' Now that Kiru doesn't have to worry about pretending to be a cosplayer the whole time, we're really keen to go.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "return"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Arthur and I have <payment> to give you if you bring us to the <planet>,\" Kiru says. \"We can find our own way back to the Hai space, as well.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Alright, I can take you there.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "accept",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Sorry, you'll have to find someone else to bring you.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "decline",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "visit"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "dialog",
            "values": [
              "You look for Arthur and Kiru, but realize that they took a ride on one of your escorts! Better depart and wait for your escorts to arrive in this star system."
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "complete"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "payment",
            "values": [
              75000
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "dialog",
            "values": [
              "Arthur and Kiru pay you <payment> before running off to the convention center. As they run away, you notice that Kiru is drawing a number of eyes from the crowd, but no one seems to suspect that he is an actual alien."
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "log",
            "values": [
              "Minor People",
              "Arthur and Kiru",
              "Human and Hai respectively, both attended the Vinci cosplay convention without a costume, gaining much attention."
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
